<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering" style="font-size:80%;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table"><span id="S4.T2.7" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:113%;">TABLE II</span>: </span><span id="S4.T2.8" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:113%;">Comparison of HTL configurations.<span id="S4.T2.8.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium"> We compare the performance of UrbanVLA after the SFT stage, with or without HTL. For simulation results, we report the model’s performance in SocialNav on MetaUrban benchmark. For real world, we report results on C-shaped sidewalk described in paper, and the results are averaged over ten trials.
</span></span></figcaption>
